,"chapter_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji070-054","person_id":"0o0_6rh_6u5","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-070-zhang"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","rationale":"依末8段附傳及引古故事局部暫接；犀首者名衍姓公孫氏與後文公孫衍明示相配。莊舄楚王與外層秦惠王分辨，卞莊子短稱莊子只取刺虎故事。未名楚魏秦王不依記憶補名，也未確證與本篇其他王同或異。子胥、曾參屬引古，比擬的僕妾與婦不補具體身分；李伯之下為地點，不當人名。","surfaces":["公叔","韓公叔"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p056","quote":"張儀為秦之魏，魏王相張儀。犀首弗利，故令人謂韓公叔曰：「張儀已合秦魏矣，其言曰：『魏攻南陽，秦攻三川。』魏王所以貴張子者，欲得韓地也。且韓之南陽已舉矣，子何不少委焉以為衍功，則秦魏之交可錯矣。然則魏必圖秦而棄儀，收韓而相衍。」公叔以為便，因委之犀首以為功，果相魏。張儀去。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:p056","text":"張儀為秦之魏，魏王相張儀。犀首弗利，故令人謂韓公叔曰：「張儀已合秦魏矣，其言曰：『魏攻南陽，秦攻三川。』魏王所以貴張子者，欲得韓地也。且韓之南陽已舉矣，子何不少委焉以為衍功，則秦魏之交可錯矣。然則魏必圖秦而棄儀，收韓而相衍。」公叔以為便，因委之犀首以為功，果相魏。張儀去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"eet_iph_y41","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"5an_r55_hee","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"9qj_prl_ehx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"令人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、比擬或未定指代，不補姓名、家屬或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"韓公叔","kind":"person","person_id":"0o0_6rh_6u5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m056-0028","star